# Usage stats turned on while Cra runs (onboarding's "Help improve Cra" row or Settings ▸
# Privacy): today's report goes out within seconds, not at the next launch or six hours later.
# The launch check (30 s in) has passed with stats off first, so only the switch can send it.
home
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": false}
env CRA_SHARING_ENDPOINT=${ORIGIN}
expect-log sharing: stats off, crash reports ask
wait 33
reject-log sharing: usage stats sent
cra://debug?sharing=on
wait 3
expect-log sharing: usage stats sent
